Copyright 2025-2026 Steve Weiland

This product is a C++ port of the NATS JWT library
(https://github.com/nats-io/jwt), Copyright The NATS Authors,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Ed25519 signing and NKeys serialization are provided by nkeys-cpp
(https://github.com/steve-weiland/nkeys-cpp), Apache License 2.0,
fetched at build time. JSON handling is provided by nlohmann/json
(MIT License), fetched at build time. Neither is vendored in this
repository.
